I'm not sure, but here's the way to find out: Save the game. Start up
a fresh game of nethack in "exploration" mode. (You'll start out with
a Wand of Wishing.) Be sure to play a character with the same
alignment as your "real" character. Now keep wishing until you get it
right. For your first try, wish for a "blessed rustproof +3 Tsurugi of
Muramasa".  Keep trying until you get the item. (If you run out of
wishes, just quit and restart.) Wield the item. Judging by the source,
it's a samurai-only, lawful artifact.

When you know you've gotten the wording right, quit and restart your
save game. Wish and be well.

(To start a game in "exploration" mode, you'll probably need to do
"nethack -X" (without the quotes). Check your docs.)

